# Environment configuration placeholders (no active third-party AI keys required)
# Optional custom licensed raster map tile provider (e.g., MapTiler / Mapbox / Stadia).
# When left unset, the app uses OpenFreeMap vector tiles (free for commercial use, no API key required, no public OSM tile servers).
# Public tile.openstreetmap.org URLs are disallowed by OSM Tile Usage Policy and rejected by verifyReleaseMapTileProvider.
# If you set a paid provider key here, remember it is embedded in the compiled APK so configure domain/rate limits and monitor quota.
# MAP_TILE_URL_TEMPLATE=https://api.maptiler.com/maps/streets-v2/{z}/{x}/{y}.png?key=YOUR_KEY
# MAP_TILE_ATTRIBUTION=&copy; MapTiler &copy; OpenStreetMap contributors
# Required for release builds (verified by Gradle task verifyReleaseLicenseServerUrl):
# LICENSE_SERVER_URL=https://license.your-domain.com
